    "reason": "No signed native-to-Tauri continuity run has been executed.",
    "blocking_conditions": [
      "Android production signing certificate lineage is external to the repository.",
      "Apple Team ID, distribution signing identity, provisioning, and effective default Keychain access group are external to the repository.",
